ight) · ~110 min · close with a short mixed MCQ+FRQ set for this unit","kind":"content","unitCode":"7","estMinutes":110,"lessonTrack":"core","scheduledMinutes":120,"links":[{"contentCode":"7.9","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"7.9#1","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"7.9#2","role":"primary","depth":"core"}]},{"code":"C8.01","position":54,"title":"Unit 8 · Lesson 1: Setting the Stage for the Cold War and Decolonization","note":"Topics 8.1 · 2 sub-keywords (2 core, 0 light) · ~110 min · warm-up: Unit 7 mixed MCQ+FRQ retrieval","kind":"content","unitCode":"8","estMinutes":110,"lessonTrack":"core","scheduledMinutes":120,"links":[{"contentCode":"7.9","role":"review","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.1","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.1#1","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.1#2","role":"primary","depth":"core"}]},{"code":"C8.02","position":55,"title":"Unit 8 · Lesson 2: The Cold War","note":"Topics 8.2 · 2 sub-keywords (2 core, 0 light) · ~110 min","kind":"content","unitCode":"8","estMinutes":110,"lessonTrack":"core","scheduledMinutes":120,"links":[{"contentCode":"8.2","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.2#1","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.2#2","role":"primary","depth":"core"}]},{"code":"C8.03","position":56,"title":"Unit 8 · Lesson 3: Effects of the Cold War","note":"Topics 8.3 · 2 sub-keywords (2 core, 0 light) · ~110 min","kind":"content","unitCode":"8","estMinutes":110,"lessonTrack":"core","scheduledMinutes":120,"links":[{"contentCode":"8.3","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.3#1","role":"primary","depth":"core"},{"contentCode":"8.3#2","role":"primary","depth":"core"}]},{"code":"C8.04","position":57,"title":"Unit 8 · Lesson 4: Spread of Communism After 1900","note":"Topics 8.4 · 2 sub-keywords (2 core, 0 light) · ~110 min","kind":"content","unitCode":"8","estMinutes":110,"lessonTrack":"core","scheduledMinutes":120,"links":[{"contentCode":"8.4","role":"p